    "name": "UPS Track Alert",
    "description": "Push-based tracking subscription to enable near real time visibility. Can also be enhanced to include Delivery Photo Confirmation.\n\nVisit the full [UPS Track Alert Documentation](https://developer.ups.com/api/reference?api=trackalert) and [UPS Track Alert Enhanced Documentation](https://developer.ups.com/api/reference?api=trackalertenhanced) for more details!\n\nYou can also view our [Track Alert Product Information](https://developer.ups.com/api/reference/trackalertenhanced/product-info) to see what this API integration can do for you.\n\nThis is a premium API, and is currently only available for our US-based subscribers.",
